  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Structural separation of accounts in key State-owned enterprises to align with EU State aid rules</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will implement the reform on the structural separation of accounts between Public Service Obligations (PSO) and non-PSO activities of key State-owned enterprises (SOEs) in Ukraine in alignment with EU State aid rules. It is in line with the key reforms in the SOE sector foreseen by the Ukraine Plan. The action will aim to improve the transparency and the corporate governance of the SOE sector and help the country align with the EU acquis on State aid, which is important for the EU accession process.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
